stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> created: POST /payments<br/>with Idempotency-Key
    
    created --> processing: Provider responds<br/>with checkout URL
    
    processing --> succeeded: Webhook arrives<br/>signature verified
    processing --> failed: Webhook: payment_failed<br/>OR provider timeout
    processing --> succeeded: Reconciler detects<br/>provider success (15min+)
    
    succeeded --> refunded: POST /payments/{id}/refunds<br/>with Idempotency-Key
    
    succeeded --> [*]: Final state
    failed --> [*]: Final state
    refunded --> [*]: Final state
    
    note right of created
        DB: payment_intents row
        Status: created
        Redis: idempotency cached
    end note
    
    note right of processing
        Provider: charge initiated
        Checkout URL returned
        User redirected to pay
    end note
    
    note right of succeeded
        Webhook verified (HMAC-SHA256)
        Ledger entries created atomically:
        - DEBIT provider
        - CREDIT merchant (net of fee)
        - CREDIT gateway:fees
        
        Merchant webhook enqueued
    end note
    
    note right of failed
        No ledger entries
        No merchant webhook
        Reason stored in DB
    end note
    
    note right of refunded
        Inverse ledger entries:
        - DEBIT merchant
        - CREDIT provider
        
        Partial refunds supported
    end note
